  "sculpt": {
    "_about": "THE DROMEDARY (2026-11-05, 2nd pass): one long mound of a hump, rising behind the withers (the rider's seat, species.js saddle(), is on the withers before it: a Tuareg saddle's), peaking past the middle of the back and falling over the loin; the body narrow and shallow on long legs, the sternal pad under the chest; the neck low out of the chest, forward and down, then up in a long curve to a head carried level; a rounded brow over heavy-lidded eyes, small round ears, a long muzzle, the split upper lip overhanging the slack lower one, slit nostrils; knee pads, thighs held in close, two toes on broad flat pads; the tail kept SHARP PASS 2 (2026-11-08): the pointed parts -- hnaili, hnailo, naili, nailo (4 in all) -- are the engine's sharp `horn`s (sharp.js), made from the field shapes they replaced by tools/creaturegen/sharp/ (claws.py, teeth.py, spikes.py, antlers.py, bills.py): rooted in the body, tips pointed; RE-RUN those after this species' generator. (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): small round cupped sheets (sharp.js `fin`); the roots faired.",
